expression: "Manual::new(\"demo\").command(Command::new(\"show\").help(\"Show a variable in a function.\").flag(Flag::new().long(\"--all-targets\").help(\"Check all targets.\")).option(Opt::new(\"PATH\").long(\"--path\").separator(\" \").help(\"The file to analyze.\"),).argument(Arg::new(\"FUNCTION_PATH\").help(\"The function to analyze.\")),).without_version().render()"
---
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH DEMO 1
.SH NAME
demo
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdemo\fR [COMMAND]
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBshow\fR [FLAGS] [OPTIONS] FUNCTION_PATH
Show a variable in a function.
.RS 4
.TP
\fB\-\-all\-targets\fR
Check all targets.
.TP
\fB\-\-path\fR \fIPATH\fR
The file to analyze.
.TP
\fIFUNCTION_PATH\fR
The function to analyze.
.RE
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.TP
\fB0\fR
Successful program execution.
.TP
\fB1\fR
Unsuccessful program execution.
.TP
\fB101\fR
The program panicked.
